            <tr><th>App</th><th>What it's for</th><th>Notes</th></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>WeChat</strong></td><td>Messaging + payments</td><td>The single most important app. Link your foreign card to WeChat Pay.</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Alipay</strong></td><td>Payments</td><td>Backup payment app; also links foreign cards.</td></tr>
